                                                "sense_id": "93f568b2-703f-30b1-91f0-4bf944522bb6",
                                                "text": "When Red Dwarf had stopped for supplies at Miranda, he'd spent the last afternoon of his three-day ship leave and all his wages buying the smallest, healthiest animal with the best pedigree he could find."
